flowchart TB
    A[AI Request] --> B[Retry Budget]
    A --> C[Tool Call Budget]
    A --> D[Retrieval Fan-out Budget]
    A --> E[Token Budget]
    A --> F[Latency at Commit Budget]
    A --> G[Evidence Coverage Budget]

    B --> H{Exceeded?}
